        "preheader": "IT STARTS WITH A VISION",
        "heading": "ONE OF MANY",
        "body": "<p>When one finds themself inspired, they strive. One who strives for long enough is bound to achieve. Achievement leads to celebration, celebration leads to inspiration, and from there we start again.<br/><br/>In those beautiful moments where fresh ideas come to life in our hands and minds, legends are born should we find the strength to hold onto them. To strive.<br/><br/>Like many endeavors, MUSE started off as a dream that became a vision. That vision became a plan and now that plan is a business seeking to enhance the moments and empower the people who inspire. Why? Because it is through inspiration that we create more moments worth celebrating.<br/><br/>And here at MUSE, we LOVE to party.</p>",
